# Contributing

Keep canonical skills portable and place repository-specific bindings in
overlays. Tests support PowerShell 7.4 or later and Pester 6.2 or later; the
checked-in runner executes Pester 6.2.0 exactly. Run
`./tools/Validate-Repository.ps1` and
`./tests/Invoke-PesterShards.ps1 -Path ./tests` before proposing a change. Do
not edit vendored runtime cores without recording whether the change is
upstream, overlay-specific, or a pending divergence.
